{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4ef5a56366ff96960578adb1f2dd21ab0048735ca26dfe01e81e7cd8f29bd34e", "ja": "天使たちの戦い", "zh": "天使们的战斗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e82dc1b18aee848636fbcb4f9837c8c74cd2b7a26524ed32a4ac8fda13b4f744", "ja": "BOT6戦目は、なんと同タイプ・グループ\n対決が行われることに。ANGEL内での勝負\nに選ばれたのは、風花、真美、あずさ、\nこのみ、麗花、エレナ。そして気負い立つ\n彼らのそばには、不思議な気配が……。", "zh": "BOT第6战，竟然迎来了同类型团队\n之间的对决。在ANGEL内部的较量中\n被选中的是风花、真美、梓、\n木实、丽花、埃琳娜。而在干劲十足的\n她们身边，有着奇妙的气息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e1d28f9e98ce8a37679f0c3b0a9c930f12c6021df883ed3707294175d45d7d47", "ja": "……というわけで、ここにいるみんなには、\n同グループ対決のトップバッターをお願いしたい！", "zh": "……事情就是这样，我想拜托在场的各位，\n来担任同分组对决的打头阵选手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1060d94f28cb77028f3d7d44c9d9057686b3a84d7525c263ff837bd95491f1fd", "ja": "ええと……私たちANGEL STARSも、\n2つのチームにわかれていますよね？", "zh": "那个……我们ANGEL STARS也分成了2个队伍，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "aaa2d6458eb4782cd2f5fd120a6e79d94796fa246c47446fa80c91835b5ce016", "ja": "ウン！　この中だと、ワタシとマミとコノミが\n同じAngel [charming]だヨ♪", "zh": "嗯！在这里面，我、真美和木实属于同一个Angel [charming]哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "32eb139bc840b62e61c6172a2f81737306d26a0e8ff579ea86eaaa084d6dbf04", "ja": "ええ。それから、私と風花ちゃんと麗花ちゃん……\nでしたよね？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "是的。还有我、风花和丽花……没错吧？　{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f9e2156ec98ce3aa07473588e9c73b8471f67144fe4c309d63a3dc2be05a9a0c", "ja": "はい。でも今回は、そのチーム分けも関係なしに\n競い合って、高みを目指してもらいたいな、と。", "zh": "是的。不过这次我想让大家不受队伍分组的限制，彼此竞争，一同向更高的目标迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "57d666a292e583f6fdca86e0c962d50a1d17d3b2c8b37e601a9582166b557d20", "ja": "わーいわーい、待ってました♪　Angel \n[sweetie]で、頂上目指しちゃいますよ！", "zh": "太好啦太好啦，等好久了♪　我要作为Angel \n[sweetie]，向着顶点进发啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "ca8059f23531771ce9e43cca1a121409d6a213447a8aa70b1a901ef6fa7c222c", "ja": "麗花ちゃんは、開催宣言公演のステージもあった\nものね。あの時は、何が始まるのかとハラハラしたわ。", "zh": "丽花当时也参加了开幕宣言公演的舞台呢。那时候真让人捏了把汗，不知道究竟会开始什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "a5980ccf193ed45fec2cf4723b5d6d0598a7e9ff27c10e830ef5149752155d7d", "ja": "とにかく、今回はAngel内での戦いって\nことよね。私たちで盛り上げていきたいわね。", "zh": "总之，这次是Angel内部的较量吧。我们也要一起把气氛炒热起来呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "166281b5df7e7f96856b2fa5290550f4112ab1101c1d779095170e1679462445", "ja": "でも……\n対決って、具体的には何を競うんでしょう～？", "zh": "不过……\n说是对决，具体要比什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "d41b4f4dbc5bd40561bb9b4dead80812516f4b6f5b0f3bf0a8b4e210acd7833b", "ja": "あずさお姉ちゃん……そんなの決まってるっしょ？\nこの6人を見なよ！", "zh": "梓姐姐……这不是明摆着的吗？看看这6个人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "e87c3097208aa3ff5c50e531dff21e66f2f495f604e0fc8b1f9ef16b80375f5d", "ja": "当然、スーパーセクシー対決でしょ！！\nアッハーン、かかっておいで～ん♪", "zh": "当然是超级性感大对决啦！！\n啊～哈，尽管放马过来吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "6bf84a6134f4252ed17dd9bbe1d7b0123e5706e875635348355d146977d4c84d", "ja": "間違いないわね！　見てなさい、お姉さんの\nアダルティ、うんと見せつけちゃうんだから♪", "zh": "没错！看好了，让你们好好见识一下姐姐的成熟魅力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "815353e992a60f0dc1b3886e28fd24402462f6f0684e64bfe1be748dfa1709d8", "ja": "ま、待ってください！　やっぱりアイドルの\n勝負なんだし、ここは正統派な勝負で……。", "zh": "请、请等一下！既然是偶像之间的\n较量，这里还是正统派的比拼更好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "e16344130c95130c75d506af28f8dafd8b390e58b4c110ce71168914afa89564", "ja": "高いところを目指すんだから、\n肺活量が大事じゃないかな？　ぷっぷか勝負！", "zh": "既然目标是登上高处，肺活量应该很重要吧？噗噗咔对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "8025834633eb36aaf591696be238113ee22256e4c20ed42dee04c4e4965c3230", "ja": "アイドルならダンスも大事だヨ～。\nサンバ対決とか、まだやってないよネ？", "zh": "作为偶像，舞蹈也很重要哦～  \n桑巴对决之类的，我们还没比过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b4ce2d14580824b8690a08103d5b6933a89662e1d359701ad69c553865f221d3", "ja": "まあ、対決内容に関してはおいおい考えるとして、\nみんな乗り気みたいで助かるよ。", "zh": "对决的内容之后再慢慢考虑，\n大家好像都挺有干劲的，帮了我大忙啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a32059357b451cec06f9a6d02775f67c43a7339f5af126d7e59bcae4a5856c40", "ja": "もちろん、新曲も用意するから。\nとりあえず、全力でぶつかってくれ！", "zh": "当然，新歌也会准备好的。\n总之，请你们全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1017_gekijyounotamasii", "source_sha256": "c1df1fc97174fe8bc74af9985594b4a4fe4aa07531fc5c383b157c38ef2b0902", "ja": "……せ、ない……", "zh": "……不能、原谅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "796cb62a450f63d672183e5fe92b1a1ee65465ba332ad2df878953acfc52ea20", "ja": "……え？　今、誰か……何か言ったか？", "zh": "……咦？刚才，有人……说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "9943c4413b427a465cb4c713cf278c49870264eae6590b481d4397a662fd6f92", "ja": "ウン？　何か聞こえた？", "zh": "嗯？你听到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a1c046aad772d65df5f18b7671bcef59c1d9ce69863220be9b384eb0a4aaa3b7", "ja": "いや、ええと……？", "zh": "不，呃……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1021_gekijyounotamasii", "source_sha256": "07f355679bdaa12f50d1597665a86f8a335b702806b7975d2866c7373088a274", "ja": "……めない……と……", "zh": "……不……的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "340cc6a0bb722802603573ff8627130932a8f6661ebb402acbab80408fa86a25", "ja": "あれっ！？　やっぱり、何か声みたいなものが……？", "zh": "哎！？果然好像有什么声音……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7f4fe4b3e0636842a92a1f47f4e2e0c218a3c0d28862c4788ad07c25c2370769", "ja": "大丈夫ですか？　{$P$}さん。\nひょっとして、疲れているんじゃ。", "zh": "你没事吧？{$P$}先生。\n难道说是太累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9f67e9f2e5f3025afc49ae343fd933c017e67e55906c0988abed9f77595616a7", "ja": "あ、いや……空耳かな？\nゴメンゴメン、それじゃみんな、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "啊，没事……是我听错了吗？\n抱歉抱歉，那大家就拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
